      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Road transport or road transportation is a type of transport using roads. It can be roughly grouped into the transportation of goods and transportation of people. Road transport means transportation of goods and personnel from one place to the other on roads. Road is a route between two destinations, which has been either paved or worked on to enable transportation by way of motorised and non-motorised carriages. There are many advantages of road transport in comparison to other means of transport.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "公路运输或公路运输是一种使用公路的运输方式。它大致可分为货物运输和人员运输。公路运输是指通过公路将货物和人员从一个地方运到另一个地方。道路是指两个目的地之间的一条路线，这条路线已经铺设或施工，以便于机动车和非机动车的运输。与其他运输方式相比，公路运输有许多优势。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
